1
00:00:00,611 --> 00:00:03,361
- What on earth are you talking about?
- Let me explain.

2
00:00:03,531 --> 00:00:06,951
(Sheldon:)You see,
I'm a superior genetic mutation...

3
00:00:07,118 --> 00:00:09,958
(Sheldon:)...an improvement
on the existing mediocre stock.

4
00:00:11,747 --> 00:00:14,417
(Missy:)And what do you mean,
"mediocre stock"?

5
00:00:14,584 --> 00:00:15,664
(Sheldon:)That would be you.

6
00:00:17,253 --> 00:00:20,503
(Sheldon:)But residing within you
is the potential for another me.

7
00:00:20,673 --> 00:00:23,883
(Sheldon:)Perhaps even taller, smarter
and less prone to freckling.

8
00:00:24,051 --> 00:00:27,551
(Sheldon:)A Sheldon 2.0, if you will.

9
00:00:28,055 --> 00:00:30,895
- Sheldon 2.0?
- Exactly.

10
00:00:31,058 --> 00:00:34,808
(Sheldon:)Now, I am not saying that I should be
the sole decider of who you mate with.

11
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:38,519
If you're not attracted, then the likelihood
of conception will be reduced.

12
00:00:38,691 --> 00:00:41,151
- You have got to be kidding me.
- Not at all.

13
00:00:41,319 --> 00:00:44,609
(Sheldon:)Frequent coitus dramatically increases
the odds of fertilization.

14
00:00:45,781 --> 00:00:48,701
(Missy:)Okay, Shelly, sit down.

15
00:00:51,203 --> 00:00:54,833
(Missy:)Now, I've lived my whole life dealing
with the fact that my twin brother is...

16
00:00:54,999 --> 00:00:59,019
(Missy:)...as Mom puts it,
one of God's special little people.

